  writeContentTokenVariables("next-gen-dark", "rebrand", "dark");
  writeContentTokenVariables("canvas", "canvas", "light");
  writeContentTokenVariables("canvas-high-contrast", "canvasHighContrast", "light");

  // Rest of compilation...
}
```

Generates:
