## 2. pantoken Component CSS Patterns (Inlinability Analysis)

### Pattern 1: Custom Property Inheritance (Very Common)

**Pantoken Style** (from [formats/components/src/generated/_records.css](formats/components/src/generated/_records.css#L69-L90)):
```css
.pfx-button {
  gap: var(--instui-spacing-space-xs);
  padding: var(--instui-spacing-space-xs) var(--instui-component-base-button-medium-padding-horizontal);
  font-family: var(--instui-font-family-base);
  /* etc. many more */
}
```
**Defined in**: `@pantoken/css` (`dist/properties.lean.css`, `dist/style.lean.css`)  
**Scope**: `:root` (global inheritance)  
**Juice VAR REFERENCE mode**: ✅ Works — var() preserved, theme.css provides values  
**Juice RESOLVED mode**: ❌ Fails — Juice only reads same-document `<style>`; `:root` in external file unknown  
**Browser RESOLVED mode**: ✅ Needed — `getComputedStyle(element, '--instui-*')` reads real cascade

### Pattern 2: light-dark() (Canvas Tokens, Badge, Text)

**Pantoken Style** (from [formats/components/src/components/badge/badge.css](formats/components/src/components/badge/badge.css#L64-L66)):
```css
