  --pantoken-badge-text: light-dark(
    var(--instui-component-badge-color),
    var(--instui-component-badge-color-inverse)
  );
  color: var(--pantoken-badge-text);
}
```
**Scope**: Component-level custom prop using light-dark() function  
**Juice VAR REFERENCE mode**: ✅ Works — `light-dark(var(...), var(...))` preserved; theme.css decides scheme  
**Juice RESOLVED mode**: ❌ Fails — `light-dark()` not resolved by Juice; outputs literal; browser may ignore if not supported  
**Browser RESOLVED mode**: ⚠️ Partial — `getComputedStyle()` returns resolved fallback for unsupported schemes, but light-dark() itself requires CSS Media Queries Level 5; Canvas may not support it

### Pattern 3: calc() with Variables (Modal, Checkbox)

**Pantoken Style** (from [formats/components/src/components/checkbox/checkbox.css](formats/components/src/components/checkbox/checkbox.css#L191-L192)):
```css
.pfx-toggle {
  --pantoken-toggle-inset: calc(var(--pantoken-toggle-bw) * 3);
  --pantoken-toggle-handle: calc(var(--pantoken-toggle-h) - var(--pantoken-toggle-inset) * 2);
  inset-inline-start: calc(100% - var(--pantoken-toggle-h) + var(--pantoken-toggle-inset));
}
```
**Scope**: Scoped custom props; calc() chains variables  
**Juice VAR REFERENCE mode**: ✅ Works — `calc(var(...))` preserved; all var resolution at runtime  
**Juice RESOLVED mode**: ⚠️ Partial — Juice can inline values IF all custom props in same `<style>`; cross-file inheritance unknown  
**Browser RESOLVED mode**: ✅ Works — `getComputedStyle()` resolves calc() chains fully

### Pattern 4: @property Registrations (Progress Circle, Transitions)

**Pantoken Style** (from [formats/components/src/generated/_records.css](formats/components/src/generated/_records.css#L3993-L5023)):
```css
@property --value {
  syntax: "<integer>";
  inherits: false;
  initial-value: 5;
}

@property --min { syntax: "<number>"; ... }
@property --max { syntax: "<number>"; ... }

