  width: clamp(0%, calc((var(--value) - var(--min)) / (var(--max) - var(--min)) * 100%), 100%);
}
```
**Scope**: Global @property type registrations; used in calc()  
**Juice VAR REFERENCE mode**: ✅ Works — @property preserved; types checked at render time  
**Juice RESOLVED mode**: ❌ Fails — @property must be in `<style>` for browser `getComputedStyle()` to read initial-value; Juice sees it in `<style>` but can't enforce type narrowing for calc()  
**Browser RESOLVED mode**: ⚠️ Partial — `getComputedStyle()` reads initial-value, but typed syntax only enforced if @property parsed before element creation

### Pattern 5: Icon/Logo ::before Masks with Variables (Icon Utility)

**Pantoken Style** (from [formats/components/src/utilities/icon/icon.css](formats/components/src/utilities/icon/icon.css#L18-L33)):
