**Scope**: Global selector; mask-image var  
**Juice VAR REFERENCE mode**: ✅ Works — `::before` inlined as-is (Juice preserves pseudo-elements by default); `var(--pantoken-glyph)` resolved at render  
**Juice RESOLVED mode**: ⚠️ Breaks — Juice cannot inline pseudo-element rules; outputs `::before` in fallback `<style>` tag; if `preserveFallbacks: false`, pseudo vanishes entirely; variables in `::before` never inlined anyway  
