**Scope**: Conditional rules; @media uses custom media queries or feature queries  
**Juice VAR REFERENCE mode**: ✅ Works — Juice preserves @media/@supports by default; vars stay intact  
**Juice RESOLVED mode**: ⚠️ Partial — Juice inlines base rules; fallback @media/@supports move to `<style>` (if `preserveFallbacks: true`); Canvas may not support custom media queries `(--theme-canvas)`  
**Browser RESOLVED mode**: ⚠️ Partial — `getComputedStyle()` picks winning branch, but @media/@supports must remain for responsive/fallback; can't always inline

### Pattern 7: Font-Face Declarations (Components, Fonts)

**Pantoken Style** (from [formats/components/src/rules/base/fonts.css](formats/components/src/rules/base/fonts.css), inlined to Canvas RCE as `fontsCss`):
```css
