  font-family: "Inter";
  font-weight: 400;
  src: url("../assets/fonts/Inter_18pt-Regular.woff2") format("woff2");
}
```
**Scope**: Global; URLs relative to CSS asset location  
**Juice VAR REFERENCE mode**: ✅ Works — @font-face preserved; URLs rewritten if Juice configured with asset baseURL  
**Juice RESOLVED mode**: ❌ Fails if inline mode — @font-face still needs external file; can't embed font bytes in style attribute; must keep in `<style>`  
**Browser RESOLVED mode**: ✅ Works — `getComputedStyle()` inherits font-family; @font-face stays in fallback sheet

### Inlinability Summary Table

| Pattern | Frequency | VAR REF | Juice RESOLVED | Browser RESOLVED | Notes |
|---------|-----------|---------|----------------|-----------------|-------|
| Custom property vars | Very High | ✅ | ❌ | ✅ | Inheritance critical |
| light-dark() | Medium | ✅ | ❌ | ⚠️ Canvas may not support |
| calc(var()) | High | ✅ | ⚠️ | ✅ |  |
| @property | Low | ✅ | ⚠️ | ⚠️ | Type safety lost |
| ::before masks | High | ✅ | ❌ | ⚠️ Pseudo can't inline |
| @media/@supports | High | ✅ | ⚠️ | ⚠️ Fallback needed |
| @font-face | Medium | ✅ | ⚠️ | ⚠️ External file always needed |

**Verdict**: VAR REFERENCE mode (current) is the ONLY safe approach for Juice alone. RESOLVED mode requires browser APIs.

